{
  "_comment": "Hand-verified cases for services/profit_calculator.py and frontend/src/lib/profit.ts. Amounts in EUR. break_even_price is the mathematical break-even rounded UP to the cent (then nudged up while the rounded net profit is still negative); null = variable fees are >= 100% of the price. emergency_price = max(85% of sell_price rounded half up, break_even_price).",
